  "description": "Per-project schema validation rate and error rate. Operators consult this dashboard to spot the schema-risk isolation trigger from docs/architecture/03-rabbitmq-streams.md (a project's experimental or high-cardinality event traffic would meaningfully degrade validation latency or skew metrics for unrelated projects). The top panel surfaces the per-project accepted rate; the bottom panel surfaces the per-project rejection rate broken down by reason.",
  "editable": false,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 0,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "# Per-project schema validation rate and error rate\n\nUses the Polaris ingester metrics labels `project_id`, `environment` and the rejection-reason label `reason`. Schema-shape rejections cluster around `schema_validation_failed`, `forbidden_field_present`, and `unsupported_schema_version`.\n\n- A sustained per-project rejection rate above 1%, or a sustained per-project rejection rate that exceeds the family-wide rate by an order of magnitude, is the schema-risk isolation trigger.\n- Use `polaris topics isolate --project <id> --env <env> --family <name>` once the trigger has persisted for one operational review cycle.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 10, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (project_id) (rate(polaris_ingest_batch_accepted_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Per-project accepted events (5m rate)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 0.005 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.01 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percentunit"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "textMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (project_id) (rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) / ignoring(project_id) group_left() (sum by (project_id) (rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])) + sum by (project_id) (rate(polaris_ingest_batch_accepted_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[15m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_id}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Per-project rejection ratio (15m)",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" }
          },
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 14 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "calcs": ["mean", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "pluginVersion": "11.4.0",
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "polaris-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (project_id, reason) (rate(polaris_ingest_batch_rejected_total{environment=\"$environment\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{project_id}} / {{reason}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Per-project rejections by reason (5m rate)",
      "type": "timeseries"
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "30s",
